  "title": "Cuban Sliders",
  "description": "This Cuban sliders recipe essentially makes mini Cuban sandwiches on sweet Hawaiian rolls with pulled pork, ham, Swiss cheese, and spicy Dijon butter.",
  "authors": [
    "jessicabroderick"
  ],
